{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Jacob dwelt, etc.</b> One needs to know why it was necessary to state this verse, for he already said in the previous parashah (Genesis 35:27) ״וַיָּבֹא יַעֲקֹב וְגוֹ׳ הִיא חֶבְרוֹן אֲשֶׁר גָּר שָׁם אַבְרָהָם וְיִצְחָק״, and as long as the verse does not inform us that he departed, I know that there he established his dwelling. Further, one needs to know why he repeated saying <b>in the land of his father's sojournings, in the land of Canaan</b> — and if to identify the place, he should have said in Hebron, and if to inform that it is the land of his father's sojournings, he already said in the previous parashah ״אֲשֶׁר גָּר שָׁם אַבְרָהָם וְיִצְחָק״?" "<b>Now then,</b> since in the previous parashah he preceded to inform that Esau his brother inherited Mount Seir by virtue of his father's merit, it fell upon the verse to inform the inheritance of Jacob. And he said <b>and he dwelt</b>, etc. — the intention is to inform the measure of his goodness, that he conducted himself in the land only as a sojourner, even though he saw that Esau had taken his inheritance and the Master had specified to him that He gave him the land in singled-out possession, as I explained in the previous parashah (Genesis 35:12) on the verse ״לְךָ אֶתְּנֶנָּה״ — even so, this made no impression upon him, and he lived as a sojourner just as his father had <b>in the land of Canaan</b> — meaning: that he conducted himself in it as though it were not his land but the land of Canaan." "<b>Or</b> it may say: even though it is the land of Canaan given to him as a heritage, even so he was a sojourner in it until matters came full circle by way of the generations of Joseph, which is his saying <b>these are the generations of Jacob: Joseph</b>, etc. — and he was sold to Egypt and our fathers went down to Egypt, and the One who promised brought them up to the land to fulfill His promise, and they inherited their portion."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:46:23.116916803Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}